{"id":"n55860-1-6","stage":2,"title":"목마르다 · 口渴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55860-1-6-1","ko":"아, 목말라. 뭐 마실 것 없니?","zh":"啊，口渴了。有什么可以喝的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"喂","explanation":"아：喂","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"5","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목말라.","meaning":"口渴","explanation":"목마르다：口渴；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"목마르다","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55860","senseId":"1","lemma":"목마르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마실","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없니?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"喂","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"要和别人搭话或引起注意时先发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"9e9d0b9fcf45589e","term":"목마르다","zh":"口渴","audio":"/audio/9e9d0b9fcf45589e75fe.mp3","entryId":"55860","definition":"很想喝水。","pronunciation":["몽마르다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d2ac2d05647a6d70ddd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55860-1-6-2","ko":"냉장고에 주스 있는데 마실래?","zh":"冰箱里有果汁，要喝吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"냉장고에","meaning":"冰箱","explanation":"냉장고：冰箱；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"냉장고","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31524","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉장고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주스","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는데","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마실래?","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b3bf31f65841d3e1","term":"냉장고","zh":"冰箱","audio":"/audio/b3bf31f65841d3e1822e.mp3","entryId":"31524","definition":"为避免食物坏掉或为了冷却而在低温中进行保管的箱式机器。","pronunciation":["냉ː장고"]},{"id"